{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8598653d-8bef-88a7-ba9b-396149404863",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:07:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:04:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Please, I am calling about water coming out of a pipe at the curb on my street. I am sorry, I am on the speakerphone, I am at my office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Where is the pipe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. It is at 142 Ayrault Street, in the Historic Hill. The water comes out from the pipe by the curb, and it runs onto the sidewalk. And now, with the cold, it freezes. It is a sheet of ice, the whole sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is it raining, or has there been any snow lately?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nothing. It is dry. There is no storm. The water just comes, every day, and it does not stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:05:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So a steady flow, dry weather. How long has it been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:05:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, let me think. [pause] Maybe three weeks. And it was not this bad last winter. Last winter, a little wet, nothing like this. Now people walk in the street because they are afraid to fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:05:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't blame them. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at the drainage there. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is 401-555-0185. Excuse me one moment. [pause] I am sorry, the printer here is jamming again. Please, go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. That's 401-555-0185, and the address is 142 Ayrault. I'll mark it as a icy sidewalk hazard too, so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, that is kind. Please, one more question. Do the crews work on the weekend? Because if nobody comes, it will be ice again by Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some crews are on for weekends, but it depends on what's in the queue. I'd expect someone to get out there before then, though. In the meantime, if you have salt, a little on the sidewalk helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will put some. Thank you. I only hope it is not like the other times, when I call and nothing happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:06:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. The request is in as of today. If you don't see anyone, call back and mention it's already logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please, thank you very much. [crosstalk] Sorry, this machine. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T16:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, take care."
    }
  ],
